{
"Items.PatienceRing.Desc": "An enchanted silver ring, shaped like two knots interlocking in a circle. The finishing on it is rough, as if crafted by a skilled artisan with poor tools. It soothes the mind and allows its wearer to act with patience and wisdom. "
"Items.PatienceRing.Long": "a silver ring shaped like overlapping knots"
"Items.PatienceRing.Short": "Patience Ring"
